[{"id":"17748","date":"2026-10-24T15:02:48+00:00","text":"‼️ 🇨🇲 JUVENTUS MONITOR RENNES LEFT-BACK MAHAMADOU NAGIDA Juventus are interested in Rennes left-back Mahamadou Nagida, who impressed during the 2–2 Europa League draw at the Allianz Stadium. The Cameroonian defender caught the attention of Giovanni Carnevali, Ricky Massara and Marco Ottolini, who closely monitored his performance. Massara already knows the player well from his time at Rennes, where he became familiar with the defender’s qualities and development. Juventus are assessing potential reinforcements at left-back, with Nagida emerging as another name on their radar. — tuttosport","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/IyRis20vwd7gyazSst2vvvRXtJUPwMbtx8d2kS1UMsGh8TNXTaLI7z2wDXoxGzvjzED7GbADNA-9Gjaw7WdaPsn70Z-5YIalnpuH8GecjqWnNVqjg3ZEDw0Ykn24ZSgsRI4aK1XLmAfoGJcOxGRIqPHK461mrf_NbQozw8vO5ezFuL7ZPI8bnIi0BIlXA1GXA9-lVVDNM1kRCnwQWHcEJVfnqOKHTq87Wh9UY0x-gWqgOH60vytH0seyClFd9YGVa-4Vta_cFjjnnoEWaSkH1Zo1LAmVaDlQQDD1a2tOGUdtZWrNGCtFi6rRmzJffyezvorfObWkoOwwGv8TlQQtew.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"17747","date":"2026-10-24T13:58:28+00:00","text":"‼️ Juventus face further concerns ahead of Sunday’s Serie A match against Lecce, Pape Matar Sarr experienced adductor discomfort while warming up at half-time against Rennes, however, he is expected to travel with the squad. His place in the starting XI remains uncertain. Douglas Luiz and Teun Koopmeiners could start together in midfield. Juventus players have already accumulated 59 matches missed through injury this season. Another major challenge for Luciano Spalletti as Juventus look to rediscover consistency.","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/dwx_bm6EvMf1HKVgeXpShTaRNBlk-GORG31wnykJz0OsGGEjdxC4j3u7FRGfyRf7idqWOC0ls4viaURPhsiKOc8IgIpeJwiFfecqUi9szCjcI6OwIPlqJFqwTkdyAU3Z5oga_fZALIuPm85h14EaV4CsbAht7ByL8jymDlfZ3va0LdApVCIfafoos66m8LFeN7Q7YNcUvIwHRfpAt-luBawAs0wAgFxtf4BkVFX4iKbvgOYDVmIt_2wEEx0hnYYafIZX4GQCVUoRlAytuuJjoXhhXAIaTItcdR3SjSNr6Z1NNUcVOQbfg4UMoai