ursuit of goals, I felt the goal should have stood.” “Çelik felt some muscle tightness, but he’s a very alert player and recognised the problem. However, recovering him in just two days will be difficult.”","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/CgzW2t9jJE8cn5MU7dq7N300i8ddOd6wVzM2WklSy9QtiVWzlSdhm86toGsX0w5W5k-BHl-fnCjwIqTRGFWCBd_Z0TByECml_DehjK3xs1-DnP0QZEwNqGiiN4XXxRL33eyUaVEeyRSW4wK_L_b1MhkhuAwknc5YaU7xi6oVjOTbrA3hYYg2q8HjD-ZM0ZmUaiFUAujfUexsqHvI0wWcn6MQ0kQkgvQWMbKJGEFf-TGGlzCqyH57nXyNJ24_XMkb4L0OhC3CJ264FDnQIrtyp9IgHMnMb3F3XiyLmLtpOmZLdeTUotLk7NRlai9BvyN1jR2EUYlWTXrgKvIf8vpp0g.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"17733","date":"2026-10-22T18:47:23+00:00","text":"FT Juventus get their first Europa League draw and remain unbeaten. Thoughts on the match?","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/C1hrTfw-GiuarfOHrjT3Wu-W9HYId8qMPEqMvacNDtkOpnRMZ1_awCe8jvXXR83TUZvI2HqG-VZKW9rkH2T6gTPQsqC05eYq1q9dPduaniDz3UqYCXIUSq3usMmFiKLrlgsoOoTzaCraNEpyqk-8DJYjb-rh4ZKOcFFNWR_hzAl5IkNH3ryf4E1XD20YWyUtPkuImLWmhkZvpAKQncOgWb7i4U_0jLMDEIue__lq0XC791rVkY-t9O_J8oCvlkbTxQZrYtCvYKp754m29Kzidm08T5KWHnLdMYj6F-EOE4lgieoQTW2maBncpJDIaGM7IJThct4-DKyQYI5G4b93xg.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"17732","date":"2026-10-22T18:37:43+00:00","text":"90+1' | Substitution: Off: Cambiaso On: Alajbegović","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"17731","date":"2026-10-22T18:37:20+00:00","text":"90+1' | After VAR review, the goal is cancelled for an offside position. The score remains 2-2","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"17730","date":"2026-10-22T18:35:49+00:00","text":"88' | LUCUMIIIIIIIIIII&#33;&#33;&#33;&#33;&#33;&#33;&#33; The Colombian scores the go-ahead goal after he pounces on the loose ball in the box from the corner&#33;","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"17729","date":"2026-10-22T18:13:37+00:00","text":"66' | BIG NICK WOLTEMADEEEEEEEEEE&#33;&#33;&#33;&#33; The German converts from the spot to level the game&#33;","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/eD