d when it came to making the decision in that particular incident. “I don’t know the rules perfectly, but the way the incident unfolded certainly leaves room for interpretation. I was very disappointed when I watched it again in the locker room. “Lucumi made a mistake with his movement, but it wasn’t as though anyone had interfered with him. Considering that we should always encourage attacking football and the pursuit of goals, I felt the goal should have stood.” “Çelik felt some muscle tightness, but he’s a very alert player and recognised the problem. However, recovering him in just two days will be difficult.”","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/dO37vMVImDWbVlZ9kMV7ttU9jUUrb9P_Isw5B42h7fQX48OqeRVc_P3ObqS-VpN3xiU2HE_wTFCoLCU0hnMsCgy54uTQrXW12HC7vTJ2s-e7b9t_-JHV44ixBe7CcpV1rnVl7-r1aGnZUWRx25ee5_Ly2Xt3RpCtKS2YTJBCC3aGFvLgGOp_bg8Y124GyBldNJz8Zmhjm_6_uW1Ve1BJK6Uqngl8nZo41u0qE64M8FPddODqbebu5tfu1VHJa4to4hb6ZP_KqSrGvjua4gtv5tiQbuj2u6TZAZ63AvrqZV9s3x9ne2bDWt48_m0ZdCwBz45R14g9BidUKrQH04vRMw.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false}]
